ASSIGNED: docs/watcher-continuity.md names this lane as owner of unifying the two
delivery-record mechanisms - the fork's pid-keyed
state/.watch-successor-output.<pid> handoff and upstream's identity-matched
ledger. Recording the honest scope: this branch is not a party to that conflict.
The successor-output handoff is merge-base fork code this branch never touched,
and the ledger is upstream's. The assignment is real and accepted, but it is a
THIRD piece of work alongside the two ask-user defects, not something the rebase
resolves. Both mechanisms stay live and correct until it is done; upstream's own
