Preliminary reading, to be verified when that work starts rather than assumed:
the ledger is the stronger primitive - identity-matched rather than pid-keyed,
bounded, and it survives a drained wake queue - so the likely end state is the
handoff retiring into it. That is a preliminary reading and nothing in this round
depends on it.

